<title>UK: London grain fixtures.</title>
<headline>London grain fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Halla TBN - 54,000/5 tonnes hss Nopac/Taiwan 4/15 July approx. $13.50 fio 10,000/4,000 EMC.</p>
<p>Grigorpan - 12,600 tonnes corn plus 5,700 tonnes meals and 8,000 tonnes wheat USG/Caldera 2/9 July $14.50 fio 5,000/5,500 Garnac.</p>
<p>TBN - 20,000 tonnes wheat Vancouver/Callao + Antofagasta 1/10 July $19 fio 1-2 5,000/4,000-3,000 Cargill.</p>
</text>
